3. {d}isztaran# [...] 
#tr.en: Ištarān, with the face of šuba stones, his mother is to receive the downstream sailing barge(?) 
4'. dal#-[la ...] 
#tr.en: Alla, lugalsapar, the barge that his mother is to receive (in the netherworld)(?) 
